Package: debian-minerva
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Rust desktop session for Debian
 Debian Minerva is a desktop environment with a Rust session daemon and a
 lightweight web-based shell. It provides virtual desktops, a dock, an app
 launcher, quick settings, notifications, a task manager and a set of built-in
 applications. The daemon has no external crate dependencies.
